			"widgets_values":[
				"prompt**提示词：**  \n\"16:9 aspect ratio, 3x3 grid layout, continuous narrative of a young Chinese woman demonstrating and recommending a modern Supor rice cooker in a bright, clean kitchen environment. Each frame transitions smoothly with logical storytelling and dynamic composition, focusing on the product features and user interaction. Bright, natural lighting, soft shadows, and warm color tones dominate the scene.\"\n\n**镜头1 - 全景：**  \nA modern kitchen with sleek white cabinets and a light wood countertop. The Supor rice cooker is prominently displayed on the counter, glowing softly under the natural lighting. The young Chinese woman stands beside it, smiling warmly, gesturing toward the product. Shot from a wide-angle perspective to establish the environment.\n\n**镜头2 - 中景：**  \nThe woman leans slightly closer to the rice cooker, pointing at the digital display with one hand while holding an instruction manual in the other. The camera zooms in slightly to focus on her interaction with the product. Soft lighting highlights the cooker’s metallic finish.\n\n**镜头3 - 近景：**  \nClose-up of the woman’s hand pressing the buttons on the rice cooker’s sleek touchscreen panel, showcasing its functionality. The camera captures the glowing LED display and the smooth texture of the device.\n\n**镜头4 - 特写：**  \nExtreme close-up of the rice cooker’s lid opening smoothly, revealing the inside. Steam gently rises, adding a dynamic touch to the frame. Warm lighting creates a cozy and inviting atmosphere.\n\n**镜头5 - 中景：**  \nThe woman pours rice into the cooker from a measuring cup, smiling confidently as she explains its features. The camera pans slightly to follow her movement, creating a sense of continuity.\n\n**镜头6 - 特写：**  \nA close-up shot of the rice cooker’s steaming bowl filled with perfectly cooked rice, emphasizing the product’s performance. The camera angle is slightly tilted for added visual interest.\n\n**镜头7 - 中景：**  \nThe woman serves the cooked rice onto a plate, garnished with vegetables. She looks at the camera, smiling warmly, as if speaking directly to the viewer. The lighting accentuates the food’s texture and the cooker’s polished exterior.\n\n**镜头8 - 全景：**  \nThe kitchen environment is shown again, with the woman standing beside the rice cooker, now packed with bowls of steaming food. She gestures to the product confidently, completing her demonstration. The camera pulls back slightly to emphasize the full setup.\n\n**镜头9 - 特写：**  \nA final close-up shot of the Supor rice cooker, highlighting its branding, metallic finish, and glowing LED panel. The scene fades out with soft lighting and a slight vignette effect for a polished conclusion.\n\n年轻漂亮的中国女主播出镜中文解说。"
